---
/**
 * Aside — a short side note. On ≥xl screens it sits in the right margin next to the paragraph
 * that precedes it; otherwise it renders as an inline muted block. Keep it to a few sentences.
 *
 * ```mdx
 * import Aside from "@/components/blog/Aside.astro";
 *
 * <Aside>Astro calls this "partial hydration"; the islands metaphor is from Jason Miller.</Aside>
 * ```
 */
---

<aside
  class="side-note text-muted-foreground not-prose my-4 border-l-2 pl-3 text-sm leading-relaxed"
>
  <slot />
</aside>

<style is:global>
  @media (min-width: 80rem) {
    /* Margin note: float into the gutter to the right of the 42rem prose column. */
    .side-note {
      float: right;
      clear: right;
      width: 14rem;
      margin: 0 calc(-14rem - 2rem) 1rem 1.5rem;
      border-left: 0;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
